## 2026-10-03T08:06:37.946765+00:00 - MAJOR031: source acceptance, actual pipeline still unfinished

# Major step031 - source reviews completed; actual validation chain still unfinished

Prepared 2026-10-03T08:06:37.946765+00:00. This records the selected source stage. Actual publication and a different documentation creation review remain separate steps.

